.TH ckman-fido-config-enable-long-touch-for-reset 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-fido\-config\-enable\-long\-touch\-for\-reset \- Require a long touch (up to 30 seconds) to confirm a FIDO reset
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-fido\-config\-enable\-long\-touch\-for\-reset\fR [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-pin\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Require a long touch (up to 30 seconds) to confirm a FIDO reset.
.PP
This is persistent and cannot be turned off again; only a full FIDO reset clears it (and over NFC a reset then always times out).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-pin\fR \fI<PIN>\fR
Current PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
Do not ask for confirmation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
